DISCLAIMER FOR HEALTHCARE USE:

This software template is designed to support HIPAA compliance efforts but does
NOT guarantee HIPAA compliance. Users are solely responsible for ensuring their
use of this software complies with HIPAA and all other applicable healthcare
regulations.

Before using this software in a production healthcare environment:
1. Conduct a thorough legal review
2. Complete a comprehensive security assessment
3. Obtain Business Associate Agreements (BAAs) from all service providers
4. Implement appropriate administrative, physical, and technical safeguards
5. Establish policies, procedures, and staff training programs
6. Consult with qualified healthcare compliance and legal professionals

The authors and contributors of this software provide no warranties regarding
HIPAA compliance or suitability for healthcare use. Users assume all risks
associated with the use of this software in healthcare settings.

